Hey\! A few comments from legal side (in {color:#ff5630}red{color}).

# *Section 5.4*. The Client is responsible in the event such information as stipulated in section
5.2 and 5.3 is incorrect and is to compensate the Company for any {color:#ff5630}direct{color} damages
related thereto.
# *Section 6(f)*. Not clear what kind of information is meant in the section, please clarify.
# *Section 7.2*. However, upon Client's request, and provided that the information in accordance with Section 4.3 above is adequate, Company shall be responsible in accordance with this Section 8.2. {color:#ff5630}The reference to section 8.2 since to be incorrect here. Would you please specify which liability is meant here?{color}
# *Section 7.4*. Representatives of the Company have the right to at any time visit the Client in
order to control that the working environment is acceptable. {color:#ff5630}Bolt cannot agree to any time visits. We would like the Company to provide us with 72 hours notice in advance.{color}
# *Section 7.4*. Compensation {color:#ff5630}by the Company{color} is to be paid for the remaining duration of the Assignment, subject to a maximum amount corresponding to six (6) months’ compensation for the Assignment.
